{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_43", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": 46, "width": 1396, "height": 362, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 721762279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502922617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_44", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 62, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2120395275, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 253207297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - CATCH THE CRM EVENT, PARK BAD DATA", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - CATCH THE CRM EVENT, PARK BAD DATA", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_45", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 98, "width": 1352, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 937195260, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1234510746, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "HubSpot is shown as the example CRM, any CRM swaps in at the first node and the write-back. Every event is mapped into one standard record, and anything missing or malformed waits in a\nreview table with the exact field named.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "HubSpot is shown as the example CRM, any CRM swaps in at the first node and the write-back. Every event is mapped into one standard record, and anything missing or malformed waits in a\nreview table with the exact field named.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_46", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1492, "y": -26, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 555512016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1063497604, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_47", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -10, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1708957521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1679116189, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - RUN EACH EVENT ONCE, ANSWER THE CRM FAST", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - RUN EACH EVENT ONCE, ANSWER THE CRM FAST", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_48", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": 26, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2132480061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 346094056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CRMs resend webhooks, so every event id is claimed once in a ledger and a repeat stops cold. The CRM gets its answer in milliseconds while\nthe real work carries on behind it.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "CRMs resend webhooks, so every event id is claimed once in a ledger and a repeat stops cold. The CRM gets its answer in milliseconds while\nthe real work carries on behind it.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_49", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2826, "y": -90, "width": 2092, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 714537755, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1929245187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_50", "type": "text", "x": 2848, "y": -74, "width": 2048, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1725048951, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1193309984, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - CLAUDE SHAPES IT, EVERY SYSTEM GETS ITS COPY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - CLAUDE SHAPES IT, EVERY SYSTEM GETS ITS COPY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_51", "type": "text", "x": 2848, "y": -38, "width": 2048, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 588093311, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1849076401, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Claude cleans the names, maps the plan to invoice terms and writes the team summary, into a fixed schema. Ids and amounts come straight from the CRM, never from the model. A throttled call backs off and tries again.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Claude cleans the names, maps the plan to invoice terms and writes the team summary, into a fixed schema. Ids and amounts come straight from the CRM, never from the model. A throttled call backs off and tries again.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_52", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5116, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1195809358, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1783684942, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_53", "type": "text", "x": 5138, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1540910401, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1633982922, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - WRITE IT BACK TO THE CRM, CLOSE THE LOOP", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - WRITE IT BACK TO THE CRM, CLOSE THE LOOP", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_54", "type": "text", "x": 5138, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 991070208, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 648200382, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The rep sees the invoice number, ops record and sync time on the deal itself. The ledger row\nholds every id that was created, so any sync can be traced in one lookup.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The rep sees the invoice number, ops record and sync time on the deal itself. The ledger row\nholds every id that was created, so any sync can be traced in one lookup.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_55", "type": "rectangle", "x": 6016, "y": 74, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 356416555, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 756849393, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_56", "type": "text", "x": 6038, "y": 90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 649821630, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 996247159, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_57", "type": "text", "x": 6038, "y": 126, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1002170859, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 51810463, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "One error trigger covers every step. The event is marked failed with its payload kept, and the team gets the deal, the step that broke and a\nlink to the run, ready to replay.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "One error trigger covers every step. The event is marked failed with its payload kept, and the team gets the deal, the step that broke and a\nlink to the run, ready to replay.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 188, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_58"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 211.25, "width": 256, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "vers